{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 34","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The numerator of a fraction is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/0/a3093a24e373566d8201ece31d839d91fba056fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, then denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf995d65beeb0bc13903243367ea1979b10745dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can have any value between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, both included. The values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which the numerator is greater than the denominator are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7c079e11e1a9847f735d3022a2288a3dd0d6886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{5} &lt; x \\le 2\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\le x \\le 2\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 &lt; x \\le 2\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 0 \\le x \\le 2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ -2 \\le x \\le 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"408\" height=\"55\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da7272b06f09b1f8f6b67d6d1b31a3261a4aabd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">Problem 33</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a